Package: attest
Title: Fail-Closed Machine Learning with Model Certificates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", , "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072"))
Description: Fits predictive models that carry an immutable certificate of
    validity. Leakage, calibration, conformal coverage and distribution-shift
    checks run at fit time and are stored inside the model object, bound to
    the training data by hash. Predictions are returned with an interval and a
    validity status and are refused, by default, when inputs fall outside the
    certified support. Reports (model cards) are rendered from the certificate
    so they cannot drift from the model.
